      "text": "Harvest (cane cut)\n  |\n  | MILLING: roller mills crush stalks -> extract juice (vesou)\n  | ~95-97% juice extraction\n  v\nRAW CANE JUICE (vesou): sucrose + glucose + fructose + water + organic acids\n  |\n  | CLARIFICATION: lime added -> impurities precipitate -> filtered\n  | EVAPORATION: multiple-effect evaporators concentrate juice\n  v\nSYRUP (~70-75 Brix)\n  |\n  | VACUUM CRYSTALLIZATION: controlled crystallization of sucrose\n  v\nMASSECUITE (sugar crystal + mother liquor mixture)\n  |\n  | CENTRIFUGE: separate crystals from liquor\n  v\nRAW SUGAR (sucrose crystals, 96-99% pure)\n        +\nMOLASSES (mother liquor = uncrystallizable residue)"
    },
