      "text": "MOLASSES GRADES:\n  First molasses: after first centrifuge; ~50-60% sugars; lighter\n  Second molasses: after second crystallization; ~35-45% sugars\n  Blackstrap/final molasses: after third; ~25-30% sugars; high minerals, bitter\n  Rum-grade molasses: typically second molasses or blend\n  Blackstrap: too bitter for quality rum; animal feed / industrial ethanol\n```"
