      "text": "YEAST:\n  Industrial: Saccharomyces cerevisiae pure culture\n  Traditional/heavy: Schizosaccharomyces pombe (Jamaican tradition)\n    -> Fission yeast; very different from S. cerevisiae\n    -> Produces very high esters and unconventional congeners\n  Wild/open: ambient yeasts + bacteria (clairin, some agricole)"
