      "text": "DUNDER (Jamaican tradition):\n  Still bottom residue from previous distillation runs\n  Highly acidic (pH 3-4), mineral-rich, fermentation-active compounds\n  Added back to fermenting wash: 5-25% of total volume\n  Function: lowers pH (controls unwanted bacteria), contributes to ester development,\n            adds \"back flavor\" compounds\n  Essential for traditional heavy Jamaican rum production"
    },
    {
